<title>USA: Arvin Industries Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Arvin Industries Inc Q1 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ind. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.57		  $  0.26</p>
<p> Net			 13,000		    5,900</p>
<p> Sales		    564,000		  511,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,835		   22,333</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net includes net gain on capital transactions which covers a $3.7 million gain on the sale of capital assets and a downward adjustment of $1.5 million in the carrying value of a non-controlled venture in the South American exhaust market. The net gain was equal to $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
